<BaseLayout title="About SMAG" description="Learn about SMAG's editorial purpose and approach.">
  <section class="wrap listing-page prose"><p class="section-kicker">OUR PURPOSE</p><h1>Stories with substance<span>.</span></h1><p>SMAG is an independent editorial magazine built for curious readers. We bring together news, features, analysis, opinion and practical guides across the subjects shaping everyday life.</p><h2>Our editorial approach</h2><p>We aim for clarity, context and accuracy. Every published story should serve readers, distinguish fact from opinion, and make its purpose clear.</p><h2>Get in touch</h2><p>For editorial enquiries, corrections and contributions, visit our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></section>
